@sprint1 @issue-10 @letters
Feature: [Issue #10] Fitur Mengajukan Surat Pengantar oleh Warga
  As a registered resident
  I want to submit an administrative letter application with supporting documents from home
  So that the RT administration can review my request without requiring physical paperwork

  Background:
    Given the RTConnect backend application is ready
    And I am authenticated as "resident@example.test" with password "LocalTestOnly#2026"

  Scenario: Mengambil daftar jenis surat master yang aktif
    When I send an authenticated GET request to "/api/v1/letters/types"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data" should be a non-empty list
    And the list should contain a letter type with code "DOM"

  Scenario: Warga berhasil mengajukan surat keterangan domisili dengan metode tanda tangan digital
    Given an active letter type exists with code "DOM"
    When I submit a letter application with:
      | field                | value                                              |
      | kode_surat           | DOM                                                |
      | keperluan            | Persyaratan pembukaan rekening bank syariah cabang |
      | metode_tanda_tangan  | digital                                            |
    Then the response status code should be 201
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data.status" should be "diajukan"
    And the response field "data.nomor_pengajuan" should match pattern "SRT-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{5}"
    And the response field "data.draf_ai" should not be empty
    And a notification for "Pengajuan Surat Baru" should be recorded for the RT Head

  Scenario: Warga berhasil mengajukan permohonan surat dengan metode tanda tangan basah
    Given an active letter type exists with code "KTP"
    When I submit a letter application with:
      | field                | value                                              |
      | kode_surat           | KTP                                                |
      | keperluan            | Pengantar perpanjangan KTP fisik di balai RW       |
      | metode_tanda_tangan  | basah                                              |
    Then the response status code should be 201
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data.status" should be "diajukan"

  Scenario: Pengajuan surat gagal jika keperluan permohonan dikosongkan
    Given an active letter type exists with code "DOM"
    When I submit a letter application with:
      | field                | value   |
      | kode_surat           | DOM     |
      | keperluan            |         |
      | metode_tanda_tangan  | digital |
    Then the response status code should be 400
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "VALIDATION_ERROR"

  Scenario: Pengajuan surat gagal jika jenis surat tidak valid atau tidak ditemukan
    When I submit a letter application with non-existent letter type ID 99999
    Then the response status code should be 404
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "NOT_FOUND"

  Scenario: Warga dapat melihat riwayat seluruh permohonan surat miliknya
    When I send an authenticated GET request to "/api/v1/letters/my-applications"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data" should be a non-empty list

  Scenario: Warga memeriksa rincian detail pengajuan surat tertentu
    Given an existing letter application exists for "resident@example.test"
    When I send an authenticated GET request for the application detail
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data.keperluan" should not be empty
